{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","title":"Hollow Pines Visitors","type":"project","lobe":"pines","parent":"projects/hollow-pines","desc":"Animal visitors with routines, memories and a tiny journal of encounters.","intro":"Animal visitors with routines, memories and a tiny journal of encounters.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-14","synapses":["projects/hollow-pines-visitors#1","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#2","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#3","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#4","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#5","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#6","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#7","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#8","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#9","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#10","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#11","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#12","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#13","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#14","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#15","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#16","projects/hollow-pines-visitors#17"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/e2bc5152-a101-3c04-5a9f-34a7d7450532","pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca","pplx://sessions/4651d4cc-381c-4efb-a6b8-8aa30ce8b406","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/hollow-pines/pull/26","https://example-store.test/listing-guide"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Fhollow-pines-visitors","parent":{"id":"projects/hollow-pines","title":"Hollow Pines","type":"project","lobe":"pines","parent":null,"desc":"Hollow Pines is a cozy browser game about tending a forest cabin through four seasons, with a radio, a sky and visiting animals.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-17","synapses":24,"sources":4,"children":7,"links":9,"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Fhollow-pines","api":"api/projects/v1/pages/projects~2fhollow-pines.json"},"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#1","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Visitor routine before frame-time breadcrumb","text":"the frame-time breadcrumb is derived from the visitor routine on laptops; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/4651d4cc-381c-4efb-a6b8-8aa30ce8b406"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#2","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Default-off visitor routine","text":"the visitor routine suppresses in the public demo and surfaces a plain warning when the radio station is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#3","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"One visitor routine, two surfaces","text":"visitor routine changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check at dusk is bounded evidence, not proof that the radio station works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#4","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Journal entry survives rollback","text":"the save bundle is derived from the journal entry per season; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#5","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Snowfall layer survives rollback","text":"the snowfall layer exports between versions, but this does not establish postcard acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#6","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Migration check is not acceptance","text":"the migration check exports in the public demo and surfaces a plain warning when the frame-time breadcrumb is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/hollow-pines-save-system"],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/hollow-pines/pull/26"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#7","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Protected snowfall layer","text":"an earlier draft treated the snowfall layer as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#8","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Protected postcard","text":"Sam chose to keep the postcard and the journal entry distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/e2bc5152-a101-3c04-5a9f-34a7d7450532","pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#9","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Default-off migration check","text":"Sam chose to keep the migration check and the postcard distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/e2bc5152-a101-3c04-5a9f-34a7d7450532"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#10","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"No silent snowfall layer changes","text":"snowfall layer changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check between versions is bounded evidence, not proof that the visitor routine works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/e2bc5152-a101-3c04-5a9f-34a7d7450532","pplx://sessions/25aa76c9-12cf-99c4-77be-a704bdfb51ca"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#11","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Frame-time breadcrumb with a visible gate","text":"the frame-time breadcrumb records between versions and surfaces a plain warning when the visitor routine is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#12","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Save bundle needs an owner choice","text":"the postcard is derived from the save bundle per season; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide","pplx://sessions/4651d4cc-381c-4efb-a6b8-8aa30ce8b406"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#13","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Draw budget is not acceptance","text":"the draw budget replays in the public demo, but this does not establish cabin lantern acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#14","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Frame-time breadcrumb stays explicit","text":"the frame-time breadcrumb replays at dusk and surfaces a plain warning when the cabin lantern is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://example-store.test/listing-guide"]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#15","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Draw budget before postcard","text":"the draw budget replays on laptops and surfaces a plain warning when the postcard is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors#16","page":"projects/hollow-pines-visitors","lead":"Bounded visitor routine evidence","text":"an earlier draft treated the visitor routine as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awai